{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Ace. What. Happened. ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right ","/#","#","^trigger: object","/#","\n","^Talon kidnapped me. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^What!!?? Well did you kill him? ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^No, I’m getting a bounty for him. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^Ace, what- ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^We have no choice. I need you to find the location of Ryker and lead me to him. Now. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^I hope you know what situation you’ve just put us in. Before we do anything, you’re going to need to go visit Cara. ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^Absolutely not. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^You have no choice. We need her. ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^Fine. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^Oh no, Huxley’s crew is here. ","#","^speaker: Flair ","/#","#","^portrait: flair ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}